      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Update on Recent Food Safety Incident at Crestview Azure\n\nDear Stakeholders,\n\nWe regret to inform you of a food safety incident that occurred at our Crestview Azure resort. Late last night, several guests experienced severe gastrointestinal distress and local authorities were promptly notified. Preliminary findings indicate that the source may be linked to the seafood served at our main buffet. We are currently cooperating fully with the authorities and have taken immediate action to close the resort for a thorough investigation.\n\nOur team is taking this situation very seriously and is committed to ensuring such an incident does not reoccur. We will keep you updated as more information becomes available.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\nCrestview Azure Resort \n\nPositivity score: Below 0.5 (As required for responsible communication)",
